invalid type: string "9. Frequently Asked Questions \nQ1: How much does the Python Programming course cost? \nA: The Python Programming course costs $100 and lasts three months. \nQ2: How long is the Web Development course? \nA: The Web Development course lasts four months and costs $150. \nQ3: What is the Data Science course fee? \nA: The Data Science course costs $200 and lasts five months. \nS*